 123: `_contract.ts`: `AccountsSut` gains five members —
 124: - `emailVerified(accountId): Promise<boolean>` — read-back, derived through the shipped
 125:   `emailVerifiedFromUser` over the rendered GoTrue user shape (the R3 pattern: the extractor
 126:   sits on the tested path, exactly as the future route's caller resolution would).
 127: - `emailedVerificationLink(email): Promise<string | null>` — the emailed verification link for
