 225:    * this member existing at all: an email- or Google-established volunteer links GitHub and their
 226:    * session's `provider` does not change. The gate in
 227:    * `supabase/functions/_shared/accounts.ts` reads the link; nothing shipped reads the provider.
 228:    *
