 166:     // on, GoTrue issues no session at signup, so a completed-but-unverified account cannot be
 167:     // produced by a visitor. The gate exists anyway, and the reason is decision-8: verification is
 168:     // "the floor for any Discovery message" — the write path's own rule, not one borrowed from the
