+# a Map. It is measured once, by hand, in `loop/items/AI4DEV-59/proof-local.ts`.
+#
+# WHAT IT DOES NOT CHANGE: the shipped gate in `supabase/functions/_shared/verification.ts`. That
+# module judges a response shape and refuses on anything it does not recognise, with this setting
